{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Dependency correction: linked b69c depends_on 1104 because bridge status must report paused state and 1104 introduces the durable additive pause metadata/schema. The pin prevents status plan certification against the old gate format."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786214772471039001,"uuid":"92785326-6231-4a61-9def-90a653dcc2d0"}